Ski-lovers all over the Internet, tune in your favourite WWW browser
at URL http://www.oslonett.no/Skif/HKS.html, and prepare for another
Internet broadcast of a major sports event.

Holmenkollen Skifestival is an annual event, and part of the Ski World Cup
in Nordic events. Results will start to flow on February 10, but
the server has a lot of interesting background material already:

 - statistics, medals and awards from previous years
 - updated WC'95 ranking
 - full HKS'95 program
 - background news articles
 - some photos (more later!)

Welcome to everybody!

